# Directory Layout

```
$OPENCTO_WORKSPACE/
  workflows/{workflow_id}/
    workflow.yml          ← manifest
    src/                  ← default source location
    data/                 ← persistent cross-run state (Git-ignored; no source files here)
    .git/                 ← skip when searching
    .gitignore            ← managed by OpenCTO; append only when needed
  workflow-runs/{workflow_id}/{run_id}/
    workflow.yml
    src/
    artifacts/
      steps/{step_id}/output.json  ← same-run step handoff
```

Source may live anywhere in the workflow directory except reserved or ignored paths.

